{title: Father, Let Me Know Your Will}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
and let me know what you think of this song or this method
of outreach.

Verse 2
I originally composed this song in 1981, at a piano in a small
church in Martin, TN. With college graduation just weeks away,
and the future unfolding so quickly, I sought the Lord's
guidance. Looking back now in 1998, all I can say is, He does
indeed answer prayer. May this song be of encouragement as you,
too, seek to know and follow our Father's will.

Verse 3
Father, Let Me Know Your Will
Words & Music by Lawrence Keith Holder
Copyright © 1998 Lawrence Keith Holder

Verse 4
Father, let me know Your will,
Father, let me know Your will,
For Thine alone is the Word of Truth:
Father, let me know Your will.

Verse 5
Jesus, guide me in Your Way,
Jesus, guide me in Your Way,
For Thou alone art the Bread of Life:
Jesus, guide me in Your Way.

Verse 6
Father, let me know Your will,
Father, let me know Your will,
Thy Truth has come; He abideth still:
Father, let me know Your will.
